# Copy to .client-name-watchlist.local (gitignored) or set CLIENT_NAME_WATCHLIST_FILE.
# Never commit the real file to a public repo.
# One term per line. Lines starting with # are comments. Blank lines are skipped.
# scripts/check-no-client-names.sh matches each term case-insensitively
# in scanned files. --commits and scripts/hooks/commit-msg-client-names.sh
# use the same list for commit messages. Never commit real terms.
#
# Placeholders only. In the gitignored copy, replace these with operator-local
# terms and remove the leading #. Do not commit that copy.
#
# buyer_example
# agency_client_example
# end_client_example
# network_buyer_example
# buyer_example_slug
